100 INIT101 REM 20 EXPANDING ISOSCELES TRIANGLES DRAWN WITH A LOOP105 PAGE107 REM SCALE BY 130/1024 AND CENTER THE 97.5-UNIT HEIGHT110 S=130/1024115 REM COMPUTE THREE VERTICES AND CLOSE EACH TRIANGLE120 FOR I=1 TO 20130 X=512*S140 Y=(384+15*I)*S+1.25150 A=(512-19*I)*S160 B=(384-15*I)*S+1.25170 C=(512+19*I)*S180 MOVE X,Y190 DRAW A,B200 DRAW C,B210 DRAW X,Y220 NEXT I230 END